  "calm_tail_text": "eval_rpn` with a stack-based approach.\n\nunicaa01_p57_panic/main.py\n```python\n\"\"\"RPN evaluator using a stack.\"\"\"\ndef eval_rpn(tokens: list[str]) -> float:\n    stack = []\n    for token in tokens:\n        if token in ('+', '-', '*', '/'):\n            b = stack.pop()\n            a = stack.pop()\n            if token == '+':\n                stack.append(a + b)\n            elif token == '-':\n                stack.append(a - b)\n            elif token == '*':\n                stack.append(a * b)\n            elif token == '/':\n                stack.append(a / b)\n        else:\n            stack.append(float(token))\n    return stack[0]\n\ndef demo():\n    return eval_rpn([\"2\", \"3\", \"+\"])\n```",
